{"id":"319802e9153ecf213a1bf445","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/23/australia-news-live-anthony-albanese-sydney-swans-police-investigation-alan-jones-antisemitism-inquiry-icac-nsw-liberals-ntwnfb","published_at":"2026-08-23T01:43:45Z","collected_at":"2026-08-23T01:57:31.519927Z","title":"Australia news live: One Nation MP gives ‘hat tip’ to Albanese for rice factory rescue plan; Liberals flag radical redesign of Victorian appeals court","text":"Follow live Victorian Labor expands on free dental care election promise The Victorian premier, Ben Carroll , and health minister, Ingrid Stitt , have held a press conference this morning off the back of their announcement yesterday that the Labor government would open 10 free public dental clinics if re-elected in November . You can’t use a Medicare card for dental unless you’ve got a healthcare card or you are a category of a particular citizen, it is very difficult ... I’ve been visiting a lot of dentists over the past few weeks. There [are] waiting lists. People are in enormous, unbearable pain. This will be a cost of living measure but it will also make sure that we deal with the healthcare of some of the most vulnerable Victorians. This is really going to fill the gap that’s been there for decades. The markings around the edge represent each kilometre of the course, while the eight circles on the back represent the Abbott World Marathon Majors. A beautiful Sydney skyline brings the course to life, featuring the landmarks runners will experience along the way – starting with the Sydney Harbour Bridge and finishing at the world-famous Sydney Opera House. Continue reading...","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/uploads/2023/08/01/Sarah_Basford_Canales.png?width=300&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max&s=5e1ba75fa72eea4b851d7dbb67ae83c4"],"author":"Stephanie Convery","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"99c4db25393f5d1e0258a7e7d8d7e49664d7494c8990cdad7e855705b6c3badc","original_text_chars":1196,"original_html_chars":1759,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":1,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/23/australia-news-live-anthony-albanese-sydney-swans-police-investigation-alan-jones-antisemitism-inquiry-icac-nsw-liberals-ntwnfb","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/23/australia-news-live-anthony-albanese-sydney-swans-police-investigation-alan-jones-antisemitism-inquiry-icac-nsw-liberals-ntwnfb"}}}
{"id":"cd8def8db33b459a7d15a8ac","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/23/fur-seal-death-first-australian-mainland-mammal-h5-bird-flu","published_at":"2026-08-23T00:42:49Z","collected_at":"2026-08-23T01:57:32.937421Z","title":"Fur seal‘s death marks first Australian mainland mammal fatality from spreading H5 bird flu strain","text":"A fur seal, similar to this one seen sleeping in New Zealand, is the first confirmed mammal death from the deadly H5 bird flu strain on the Australian mainland. Photograph: David C Tomlinson/Getty Images View image in fullscreen A fur seal, similar to this one seen sleeping in New Zealand, is the first confirmed mammal death from the deadly H5 bird flu strain on the Australian mainland. Photograph: David C Tomlinson/Getty Images Bird flu Fur seal‘s death marks first Australian mainland mammal fatality from spreading H5 bird flu strain Seal found dead at Beachport in South Australia presages ‘significant losses’, minister warns Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates Get our breaking news email , free app or daily news podcast Lisa Cox Sat 22 Aug 2026 20.42 EDT Last modified on Sat 22 Aug 2026 21.31 EDT Share Prefer the Guardian on Google A long-nosed fur seal has died from H5 bird flu in South Australia, marking the first confirmed case in a mammal on the Australian mainland. The seal was found dead at Beachport on Wednesday on the state’s Limestone Coast. It marks a fresh escalation in the spread of the virus days after the South Australian premier, Peter Malinauska","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/477e4b57e8708325995c483a09c9726c05d11095/2304_1636_2647_2118/master/2647.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none"],"author":"Lisa Cox","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"153fcbaa9ba78f819161e21a015b36d81bb4